.TH WAYSHADOW.CONF 5 "August 2026" "wayshadow 0.1.0" "File Formats Manual"
.SH NAME
wayshadow.conf \- configuration file for the wayshadow visualizer
.SH DESCRIPTION
The
.B wayshadow.conf
file contains user customization settings for the
.BR wayshadow (1)
visualizer.
.SH LOCATION
The file is searched for in:
.IP
.I ~/.config/wayshadow/wayshadow.conf
.PP
or under \fI$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/wayshadow/wayshadow.conf\fR.
.SH FORMAT
The configuration file is formatted in INI syntax under the \fB[settings]\fR section.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B background
Background color in hex format (e.g. \fI#000000\fR).
.TP
.B foreground
Text color in hex format (e.g. \fI#FFFFFF\fR).
.TP
.B opacity
Background opacity as a floating point value from \fI0.0\fR to \fI1.0\fR (default: \fI0.6\fR).
.TP
.B font_size
Font size in points (default: \fI65\fR).
.TP
.B geometry
Window dimensions in \fIWIDTHxHEIGHT\fR format (default: \fI840x130\fR).
.TP
.B hide_timeout
Inactivity timeout in milliseconds before hiding the overlay window (default: \fI2000\fR).
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
[settings]
background = #1e1e2e
foreground = #cdd6f4
opacity = 0.8
font_size = 70
geometry = 900x140
hide_timeout = 2500
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR wayshadow (1)
